From 03e4d4d5cd79c8740b4089397634f659b2d0b37d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rpiios <grinkod.bogdan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:02:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build xnu-hd2 with a modern Linux toolchain

- Restore executable bits on build scripts (lost in publication).
- Turn the '# HTC HD2 ...' publication notice into a C comment where it
  heads C/yacc sources, so the preprocessor accepts it.
- Add iokit/IOKit/storage/Makefile (dir is listed but had no Makefile).
- Include paths the author's build had: AppleARMPlatform for pexpert,
  osfmk/ipc+kern for osfmk and iokit, pexpert/arm for iokit.
- genassym: accept '@DEFINITION#' (modern clang prints ARM's comment char).
- Respell pre-UAL mnemonics in bcopyinout.s (tools/ual-convert.py).
- compute_pageout_gc_throttle: definition matches its prototype.
- kxld: comma between attributes.
- List HD2 display/touch/logger/COW sources that the author linked.
- Stand-ins for leo_scanout_copy_row and five diagnostic observers whose
  implementations are not in the public tree.
